{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"ArcaniaBot","id":"810907841329627137","is_bot":1,"username":"ArcaniaBot"},"author_id":"810907841329627137","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"<@148682928434577408> Hello! Your short rest is over now! Remember to call `!game sr` to get your rechargeable abilities from Avrae.","created_at":"2021-08-25T14:13:23.687000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880092501506129970","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(well I forgot to run sr but that was pretty much clearly one so)\nSabrine's head rises from the water, though she doesn't leave it entirely. '...and that's why I think we did the best we could under the circumstances, Gil. Eloise tried to offer the wolf mercy already, and... you know what happened there. And, well - there wasn't exactly anything we could do to stop Demetrius, and even if there was, it wouldn't be at all safe - I'd rather a mass murderer got a painful death than risk the lives of many innocents to make it less painful.' she sighs. 'I hope my logic makes sense. I feel like it does, at least.'","created_at":"2021-08-25T14:40:07.853000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880099229866025041","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Gave Gil a rundown of what happened?\" Roy asks from over his notes according to him, messy scribbles according to anyone else who'd be looking.","created_at":"2021-08-25T15:08:00.708000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880106246328438995","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she nods and steps out of the pond, tapping her staff to leave a water-lily by it. 'I hope he doesn't mind me talking through my thoughts for hours.'","created_at":"2021-08-25T15:09:23.574000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880106593893638154","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'But I think our actions earlier were alright. In theory, even if we could have communicated with Demetrius while he was in the bubble, it may have resulted in him getting hurt or the wolf escaping. Better not to risk it.'\nshe walks over to sit next to him, peeking at the notes.","created_at":"2021-08-25T15:13:48.903000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880107706764128356","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"At this point, to protect people of the city, we had to kill the beast. Now, it could've been done different, but at the same time, Demetrius did it in a way that would not also endanger us or others even more.\"\nRoy puts his notes down.\n\"Nobody said it'd all be simple, I suppose. Hope we'll keep remembering it, eh, Gil?\" he says, looking towards the pond.","created_at":"2021-08-25T15:28:53.971000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880111502894432266","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'That's what I was thinking. And, well... it's not like we didn't try to be merciful.'\nshe picks up the notes and... attempts to browse them. 'Are... you sure you can read this?'","created_at":"2021-08-25T15:31:23.228000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880112128923668520","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Yeah. Just graphs of how stuff would be connected. Most of the complexity is from the design of the airship engines already in place. Just gotta make it more or less efficient. And hey, it's not like all those glyphs Gil has been setting up around the place.\"\nPause.\n\"Hmm. I never actually checked them, aside from the ones he set for visual effects during the wedding. It kinda felt awkward to peek around while he was physically there. Perhaps we should check them?\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T15:34:32.748000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880112923828158475","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Sure. Don't want to accidentally set anything off.' she laughs, and jumps back up, reaching out a hand to help him up.","created_at":"2021-08-25T15:35:47.678000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880113238107357184","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
